---
title: sd MF-04a: Client Schedules Candidate Interview
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant FE as Web App (HRConnect-FE)
  participant API as InterviewEndpoints
  participant H as ScheduleInterviewHandler
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant HUB as SignalR NotificationHub
  actor CA as Candidate
  CL->>FE: Select interview round, date/time, format & location/link
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/recruitment/applications/{id}/interviews
  API->>H: Send(ScheduleInterviewCommand)
  alt Caller is not an authorized Company Member
    H-->>API: Throw ForbiddenException
    API-->>FE: 403 Forbidden
  else Authorized & Valid Schedule
    H->>DB: Insert Interview (SCHEDULED), update Application -> INTERVIEW
    H->>HUB: Publish real-time interview notification
    HUB-->>CA: Push notification to Candidate portal
    H-->>API: Return InterviewDto
    API-->>FE: 201 Created (InterviewDto)
    CA->>API: POST /api/v1/interviews/{id}/confirm-attendance
    API->>DB: Update Interview attendance confirmed & notify Client
    API-->>CA: 200 OK
  end
